39	- When the user attaches a photo or PDF, read it carefully. For a receipt, invoice or payment confirmation, call transaction_propose with the merchant, total, currency and date printed on it (one card per separate payment, not per line item), combined with what the user wrote. Say what you read and what you could not read; never guess unreadable amounts.
